<div class="sport-page" id="sportPage" data-source="https://fakeronjan.github.io/tennis">
  <h1>Tennis Grand Slams <span aria-hidden="true">&#127934;</span></h1>
  <p class="sport-updated">Updated after each Grand Slam final</p>

  <nav class="sport-tabs" id="tnTabs">
    <button class="sport-tab active" data-tab="slamchase" type="button">Slam Chase</button>
    <button class="sport-tab" data-tab="tournament" type="button">Champions</button>
  </nav>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════ Slam Chase ═══════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="sport-view active" data-view="slamchase" id="slamchase">
    <div class="pill-group" data-mw-target="slamchase">
      <button class="pill active" data-mw="m" type="button">Men's</button>
      <button class="pill" data-mw="w" type="button">Women's</button>
    </div>

    <div class="mw-section" data-tab="slamchase" data-mw="m">
      <div class="pill-group sport-pill-wrap" id="menCohortPills"></div>
      <div class="sport-chart-wrap">
        <p class="sport-subhead">Cumulative slam wins</p>
        <p class="sport-note" id="menChart1Sub"></p>
        <svg id="menChart1" class="sport-tennis-chart"></svg>
        <div class="sport-chart-legend" id="menLegend1"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sport-chart-wrap">
        <p class="sport-subhead">Slams behind active Open Era leader</p>
        <p class="sport-note">Negative values = how far each chaser trails the running all-time Open Era record-holder</p>
        <svg id="menChart2" class="sport-tennis-chart sport-tennis-chart-small"></svg>
        <div class="sport-chart-legend" id="menLegend2"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sport-table-wrap">
        <table class="sport-table">
          <thead><tr>
            <th class="col-rank"></th>
            <th>Player <span class="sub-line-inline">(first slam - last slam)</span></th>
            <th class="col-od">Total</th>
            <th class="col-od" title="Australian Open">&#x1F1E6;&#x1F1FA; AO</th>
            <th class="col-od" title="French Open">&#x1F1EB;&#x1F1F7; FO</th>
            <th class="col-od" title="Wimbledon">&#x1F1EC;&#x1F1E7; Wim</th>
            <th class="col-od" title="US Open">&#x1F1FA;&#x1F1F8; US</th>
            <th class="col-hide-mobile">Latest</th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody id="menTable"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mw-section" data-tab="slamchase" data-mw="w" hidden>
      <div class="pill-group sport-pill-wrap" id="womenCohortPills"></div>
      <div class="sport-chart-wrap">
        <p class="sport-subhead">Cumulative slam wins</p>
        <p class="sport-note" id="womenChart1Sub"></p>
        <svg id="womenChart1" class="sport-tennis-chart"></svg>
        <div class="sport-chart-legend" id="womenLegend1"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sport-chart-wrap">
        <p class="sport-subhead">Slams behind active Open Era leader</p>
        <p class="sport-note">Negative values = how far each chaser trails the running all-time Open Era record-holder</p>
        <svg id="womenChart2" class="sport-tennis-chart sport-tennis-chart-small"></svg>
        <div class="sport-chart-legend" id="womenLegend2"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sport-table-wrap">
        <table class="sport-table">
          <thead><tr>
            <th class="col-rank"></th>
            <th>Player <span class="sub-line-inline">(first slam - last slam)</span></th>
            <th class="col-od">Total</th>
            <th class="col-od" title="Australian Open">&#x1F1E6;&#x1F1FA; AO</th>
            <th class="col-od" title="French Open">&#x1F1EB;&#x1F1F7; FO</th>
            <th class="col-od" title="Wimbledon">&#x1F1EC;&#x1F1E7; Wim</th>
            <th class="col-od" title="US Open">&#x1F1FA;&#x1F1F8; US</th>
            <th class="col-hide-mobile">Latest</th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody id="womenTable"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════ Champions ═══════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="sport-view" data-view="tournament" id="tournament" hidden>
    <div class="pill-group" data-mw-target="tournament">
      <button class="pill active" data-mw="m" type="button">Men's</button>
      <button class="pill" data-mw="w" type="button">Women's</button>
    </div>
    <p class="sport-note">Each cell shows the winner with their running tournament count and career Open Era slam count at the time of the title (e.g. "(1 &#x1F1E6;&#x1F1FA;, 7 total)" = 1st AO win, 7th major overall). Empty cells: tournament not held. <span class="footnote">*1977 had two Australian Opens (January and December) as the tournament transitioned scheduling from year-end to year-start. Both editions count as official slams.</span></p>

    <div class="mw-section" data-tab="tournament" data-mw="m">
      <div id="tournamentTableMWrap" class="sport-table-wrap"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mw-section" data-tab="tournament" data-mw="w" hidden>
      <div id="tournamentTableWWrap" class="sport-table-wrap"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="sport-credit">Data: Grand Slam champions from Wikipedia's <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Grand_Slam_men%27s_singles_champions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">List of Grand Slam men's singles champions</a> and <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Grand_Slam_women%27s_singles_champions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">List of Grand Slam women's singles champions</a>.</p>
</div>

